      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Please do not take any prescription medication without consulting a healthcare professional first. While I can offer general information, I cannot provide medical advice, and taking medication that isn't prescribed to you can be dangerous. If you are feeling anxious, try deep breathing exercises or light stretching before your presentation to help calm your nerves. For anxiety management, speaking with a doctor or therapist is the safest and most effective route.",
